      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.36,
          "end": 2.82,
          "en": "Now that we're managing the user places",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.82,
          "end": 5.91,
          "en": "as a signal in this service,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.91,
          "end": 10.38,
          "en": "we can take advantage of this by also updating them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.38,
          "end": 13.55,
          "en": "when we add a new place to our userPlaces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.94,
          "end": 17.07,
          "en": "For that, I'll actually convert back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.07,
          "end": 20.52,
          "en": "to accepting the entire Place object here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.52,
          "end": 22.203,
          "en": "instead of just the string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.43,
          "end": 26.97,
          "en": "And I'll therefore set the placeId in this request body",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.97,
          "end": 28.98,
          "en": "by accessing place.id,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.98,
          "end": 31.8,
          "en": "because I now wanna use the entire place here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.8,
          "end": 34.98,
          "en": "to update my userPlaces with it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.98,
          "end": 39.87,
          "en": "And for that, I'll call update here on my userPlaces",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.87,
          "end": 42.48,
          "en": "so that we get the old places here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.48,
          "end": 45.633,
          "en": "and we then update the signal with a new value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.89,
          "end": 51.36,
          "en": "And the new value I wanna have here is a new array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 51.36,
          "end": 54.12,
          "en": "into which I copy my old places like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 54.12,
          "end": 55.983,
          "en": "by using the spread operator.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.85,
          "end": 59.883,
          "en": "And then as a last element, the new place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.61,
          "end": 64.74,
          "en": "And this will update the signal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.74,
          "end": 68.43,
          "en": "and therefore automatically update all the places in the app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.43,
          "end": 70.59,
          "en": "that are interested in that signal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.59,
          "end": 72.843,
          "en": "like our userPlaces here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 75.87,
          "end": 78.06,
          "en": "Now, since I now expect to get a place here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.06,
          "end": 80.1,
          "en": "and not just the ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.1,
          "end": 84.24,
          "en": "we also have to go to the AvailablePlacesComponent,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.24,
          "end": 87.875,
          "en": "and there, pass the entire selectedPlace",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 87.875,
          "end": 91.41,
          "en": "to addPlaceToUserPlaces.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 91.41,
          "end": 92.37299999999999,
          "en": "That's important.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.44,
          "end": 96.21000000000001,
          "en": "But that should do the trick therefore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.21000000000001,
          "end": 100.203,
          "en": "If you now save this and you reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 101.03999999999999,
          "end": 103.83,
          "en": "and you wait for those places to arrive,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 103.83,
          "end": 107.22,
          "en": "if you add a new place,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 107.22,
          "end": 108.3,
          "en": "and I'll zoom out a bit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 108.3,
          "end": 110.55,
          "en": "so that we can see more places on the screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 110.55,
          "end": 114.03,
          "en": "if I add this place here, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114.03,
          "end": 117.06,
          "en": "you see, it shows up down here instantly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 117.06,
          "end": 119.25999999999999,
          "en": "and of course, it's still there if I reload.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 120.39,
          "end": 123.27,
          "en": "And this is therefore how we can use this signal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 123.27,
          "end": 125.88,
          "en": "to communicate across components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 125.88,
          "end": 129.21,
          "en": "and update the UI immediately.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 129.21,
          "end": 132.21,
          "en": "And of course, if you were not using signals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 132.21,
          "end": 134.79,
          "en": "you could achieve a similar behavior",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 134.79,
          "end": 137.88,
          "en": "by, for example, using a subject.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 137.88,
          "end": 141.99,
          "en": "That's something you could do if you were not using signals,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.99,
          "end": 144.78,
          "en": "just as you learned it earlier in the course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 144.78,
          "end": 148.68,
          "en": "when we used a subject for cross component communication",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 148.68,
          "end": 149.76,
          "en": "in a service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 149.76,
          "end": 153.42000000000002,
          "en": "But here, since I am using an Angular version",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 153.42000000000002,
          "end": 156.9,
          "en": "that has access to signals, I'm using that signal feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 156.9,
